OL,3,AJapan's first mayor to take maternity
OL,4,Aleave lands on TIME100 Next list
OL,5,
OL,6,FShoko Kawata, Japan's first mayor to
OL,7,Ftake maternity leave, has been named
OL,8,Fone of the 100 most influential rising
OL,9,Fstars by TIME Magazine.
OL,11,FThe recognition comes weeks after the
OL,12,F36-year-old gave birth to her first
OL,13,Fchild on 15 September.
OL,15,FEarlier this year, Kawata, who is mayor
OL,16,Fof Yawata City in Kyoto prefecture, was
OL,17,Fplunged into a national debate about
OL,18,Fwhether elected officials should take
OL,19,Ftime off for childbirth.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
