OL,3,AJapan's first mayor to take maternity
OL,4,Aleave lands on TIME100 Next list
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer decision to take maternity leave
OL,7,Fdrew a mix of support and backlash
OL,8,Facross Japan, a country that is
OL,9,Fstruggling to lift birth rates.
